  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PRONI Institute of Social Education works with the training of youth leaders and with youth centers in the former Yugoslavian countries. Sida has supported this work since 1997. Now Sida wants to evaluate PRONIS work and results. Consultants: Birgitta Berggren, Bodil Eriksson. Mission in 7 weeks autumn 2002.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Stiftelsen PRONI arbetar med ungdomsledarutbildning, ungdomsg&#xE5;rdar mm i alla l&#xE4;nder i forna Jugoslavien. Sida har st&#xF6;tt verksamheten sedan 1997. Insatsen g&#xE4;ller att utv&#xE4;rdera deras arbete. Konsulter: Birgitta Berggren och Bodil Eriksson. Utf&#xF6;rs h&#xF6;sten 2002.</narrative>
  </description>
